{
  "story_id": "nightingale-terminal",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 384144,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "At about midnight Nazan went to buy them both more tea.",
      "start_ms": 1632,
      "end_ms": 5605
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "She came back.",
      "start_ms": 5605,
      "end_ms": 6670
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "She said, \"Sena.",
      "start_ms": 6670,
      "end_ms": 7876
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I want to tell you a small story.",
      "start_ms": 7876,
      "end_ms": 10288
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "It is not a big story.",
      "start_ms": 10288,
      "end_ms": 11920
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It is my own story.",
      "start_ms": 11920,
      "end_ms": 13339
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "But I want to tell you because I think it might be useful.",
      "start_ms": 13339,
      "end_ms": 17525
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Would you like to hear it?\" Sena said, \"Yes.\" Nazan settled herself.",
      "start_ms": 17525,
      "end_ms": 22421
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "She held her tea in both hands.",
      "start_ms": 22421,
      "end_ms": 24762
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "\"When I was your age,\" she said, \"I lived with my mother in a small village in central Turkey.",
      "start_ms": 24762,
      "end_ms": 31503
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "My father worked in Istanbul.",
      "start_ms": 31503,
      "end_ms": 33631
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "He was — he was a very poor man who had come to the city to look for work when he was young, and he had found work in Istanbul as a — a cook.",
      "start_ms": 33631,
      "end_ms": 43707
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "In a restaurant.",
      "start_ms": 43707,
      "end_ms": 44913
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "He sent money home to my mother.",
      "start_ms": 44913,
      "end_ms": 47254
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "But he was not able to come home often.",
      "start_ms": 47254,
      "end_ms": 50092
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "When he did come, it was for one week a year, at Ramadan.",
      "start_ms": 50092,
      "end_ms": 54208
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "That was all we saw of him.",
      "start_ms": 54208,
      "end_ms": 56194
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I loved him very much.",
      "start_ms": 56194,
      "end_ms": 57826
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "He loved me very much.",
      "start_ms": 57826,
      "end_ms": 59458
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "But he was gone.",
      "start_ms": 59458,
      "end_ms": 60664
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "That was the shape of my childhood.\"",
      "start_ms": 60664,
      "end_ms": 63361
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "\"When I was eleven — the same age as you — my father asked me to come to Istanbul for a week to visit him, during the school holiday.",
      "start_ms": 63361,
      "end_ms": 72868
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Not with my mother.",
      "start_ms": 72868,
      "end_ms": 74287
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Just me.",
      "start_ms": 74287,
      "end_ms": 74926
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "It was the first time I had been to Istanbul.",
      "start_ms": 74926,
      "end_ms": 78190
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "I took a train — a bus, actually — for two whole days, alone, at eleven years old.",
      "start_ms": 78190,
      "end_ms": 84079
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "That was different from now.",
      "start_ms": 84079,
      "end_ms": 86136
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "At that time it was normal for children to travel alone if they had to.",
      "start_ms": 86136,
      "end_ms": 91245
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Nobody thought it was strange.",
      "start_ms": 91245,
      "end_ms": 93444
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I got to Istanbul.",
      "start_ms": 93444,
      "end_ms": 94793
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "My father met me at the bus station.",
      "start_ms": 94793,
      "end_ms": 97418
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "He took me to the small room he lived in.",
      "start_ms": 97418,
      "end_ms": 100398
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He worked in the evenings, at the restaurant, so I helped him.",
      "start_ms": 100398,
      "end_ms": 104868
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I brought him tea.",
      "start_ms": 104868,
      "end_ms": 106216
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "I sat in a corner of the kitchen while he cooked.",
      "start_ms": 106216,
      "end_ms": 109764
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "I watched.\"",
      "start_ms": 109764,
      "end_ms": 110544
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "\"After that first visit, my mother let me go to see him for a week every summer.",
      "start_ms": 110544,
      "end_ms": 115732
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "From when I was eleven until when I was seventeen.",
      "start_ms": 115732,
      "end_ms": 118999
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Seven summers.",
      "start_ms": 118999,
      "end_ms": 119960
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Every summer I took the bus.",
      "start_ms": 119960,
      "end_ms": 121817
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Every summer I helped him at the restaurant.",
      "start_ms": 121817,
      "end_ms": 124700
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Every summer I watched him cook.",
      "start_ms": 124700,
      "end_ms": 126814
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "He taught me.",
      "start_ms": 126814,
      "end_ms": 127710
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "He taught me a lot.",
      "start_ms": 127710,
      "end_ms": 128991
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "When I was fifteen he had saved enough that he could come home for two months in the summer instead of one week at Ramadan.",
      "start_ms": 128991,
      "end_ms": 136934
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Then when I was seventeen — the last summer I went to see him in Istanbul — he told me he had saved enough to come home for good.",
      "start_ms": 136934,
      "end_ms": 145261
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "He was going to close his part of the business in Istanbul and come and live with us again.",
      "start_ms": 145261,
      "end_ms": 151154
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "And he did.",
      "start_ms": 151154,
      "end_ms": 151923
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "He came home.",
      "start_ms": 151923,
      "end_ms": 152819
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "He lived with my mother and me for another twenty-two years.",
      "start_ms": 152819,
      "end_ms": 156727
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Until he died.",
      "start_ms": 156727,
      "end_ms": 157687
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "He died an old man in a small village in central Turkey with his family around him.\"",
      "start_ms": 157687,
      "end_ms": 163196
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "\"Sena,\" said Nazan.",
      "start_ms": 163196,
      "end_ms": 164477
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "\"I want you to hear the important part.",
      "start_ms": 164477,
      "end_ms": 167039
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Those seven summers I was going to Istanbul to see my father.",
      "start_ms": 167039,
      "end_ms": 171011
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "That was — very hard.",
      "start_ms": 171011,
      "end_ms": 172420
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I missed my mother the whole week.",
      "start_ms": 172420,
      "end_ms": 174662
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "When I came back, I missed my father.",
      "start_ms": 174662,
      "end_ms": 177096
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "That was the whole shape of my life.",
      "start_ms": 177096,
      "end_ms": 179466
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "When I was your age I thought — I will never really be happy.",
      "start_ms": 179466,
      "end_ms": 183437
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "I will always be missing someone.",
      "start_ms": 183437,
      "end_ms": 185615
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "That is what I thought.\"",
      "start_ms": 185615,
      "end_ms": 187152
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "\"But — and here is what I want you to know — I was wrong.",
      "start_ms": 187152,
      "end_ms": 191530
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "I was not unhappy.",
      "start_ms": 191530,
      "end_ms": 192964
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I was learning something that most children do not learn.",
      "start_ms": 192964,
      "end_ms": 197342
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "I was learning how to be with people, and how to remember people.",
      "start_ms": 197342,
      "end_ms": 202323
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "I was learning that you can love someone deeply and not see them for months, and it does not damage the love.",
      "start_ms": 202323,
      "end_ms": 210626
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "In fact it makes the love — different.",
      "start_ms": 210626,
      "end_ms": 213570
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Bigger.",
      "start_ms": 213570,
      "end_ms": 214173
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "More stubborn.",
      "start_ms": 214173,
      "end_ms": 215306
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Because it has to be big enough to survive the not-seeing.",
      "start_ms": 215306,
      "end_ms": 219759
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "When I finally lived with both my parents, when I was seventeen, I already knew how to love people through absence.",
      "start_ms": 219759,
      "end_ms": 228514
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "That has served me my whole life.",
      "start_ms": 228514,
      "end_ms": 231081
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I have lived in Istanbul for fifty-six years.",
      "start_ms": 231081,
      "end_ms": 234553
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "My mother, my father — they died in the village.",
      "start_ms": 234553,
      "end_ms": 238251
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "My son now lives in Frankfurt.",
      "start_ms": 238251,
      "end_ms": 240591
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "My friends are scattered.",
      "start_ms": 240591,
      "end_ms": 242553
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "I do not have anyone close to me.",
      "start_ms": 242553,
      "end_ms": 245120
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "But I am not lonely.",
      "start_ms": 245120,
      "end_ms": 246705
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "I know how to be with people who are not there.",
      "start_ms": 246705,
      "end_ms": 250328
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "You are learning this too, Sena.",
      "start_ms": 250328,
      "end_ms": 252819
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Right now.",
      "start_ms": 252819,
      "end_ms": 253649
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "That is what these flights are teaching you.\"",
      "start_ms": 253649,
      "end_ms": 257196
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Sena sat with this for a while.",
      "start_ms": 257196,
      "end_ms": 259612
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "She said, \"How do you — how do you do it.",
      "start_ms": 259612,
      "end_ms": 262782
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "How do you love someone who is not there.\" Nazan thought.",
      "start_ms": 262782,
      "end_ms": 267160
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "She said, \"You think of them at specific times.",
      "start_ms": 267160,
      "end_ms": 270783
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "You do not try to hold on to them all the time — that will exhaust you.",
      "start_ms": 270783,
      "end_ms": 276217
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "You choose a time.",
      "start_ms": 276217,
      "end_ms": 277651
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "For me, when I was your age, I always thought of my father at sunset, wherever I was, and I always thought of my mother in the very early morning.",
      "start_ms": 277651,
      "end_ms": 288747
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Sunset was his time.",
      "start_ms": 288747,
      "end_ms": 290332
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Morning was hers.",
      "start_ms": 290332,
      "end_ms": 291690
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "That way I could go on with my day.",
      "start_ms": 291690,
      "end_ms": 294407
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "But those two moments were theirs.\"",
      "start_ms": 294407,
      "end_ms": 297200
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "\"Also — you write to them.",
      "start_ms": 297200,
      "end_ms": 299238
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Real letters, if you can.",
      "start_ms": 299238,
      "end_ms": 301201
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Not the fast little messages.",
      "start_ms": 301201,
      "end_ms": 303465
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Real letters.",
      "start_ms": 303465,
      "end_ms": 304522
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "My father and I wrote letters for those seven years.",
      "start_ms": 304522,
      "end_ms": 308522
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "He kept mine.",
      "start_ms": 308522,
      "end_ms": 309579
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "When he died, my mother found them all in a box.",
      "start_ms": 309579,
      "end_ms": 313277
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I still have them.",
      "start_ms": 313277,
      "end_ms": 314711
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "They are proof that we loved each other across a distance.",
      "start_ms": 314711,
      "end_ms": 319165
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Something you can hold.\"",
      "start_ms": 319165,
      "end_ms": 320976
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "By about two in the morning, Sena was sleepy.",
      "start_ms": 320976,
      "end_ms": 323770
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Nazan noticed.",
      "start_ms": 323770,
      "end_ms": 324681
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "She said, \"Sena.",
      "start_ms": 324681,
      "end_ms": 325714
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Sleep for a while.",
      "start_ms": 325714,
      "end_ms": 326868
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "I will stay here.",
      "start_ms": 326868,
      "end_ms": 327961
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "I will not leave.",
      "start_ms": 327961,
      "end_ms": 329054
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "When it is time for your flight I will wake you.",
      "start_ms": 329054,
      "end_ms": 332030
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "You are safe.",
      "start_ms": 332030,
      "end_ms": 332881
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Sleep.\" Sena said, \"Are you sure.\" Nazan said, \"Yes.",
      "start_ms": 332881,
      "end_ms": 336100
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "I have slept many times in airports.",
      "start_ms": 336100,
      "end_ms": 338347
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "It will be better for you if you sleep for a few hours.",
      "start_ms": 338347,
      "end_ms": 341749
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Come.",
      "start_ms": 341749,
      "end_ms": 342113
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Put your bag under your head.",
      "start_ms": 342113,
      "end_ms": 343935
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Curl up.",
      "start_ms": 343935,
      "end_ms": 344482
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I will read my book.\"",
      "start_ms": 344482,
      "end_ms": 345879
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Sena did not think she would fall asleep.",
      "start_ms": 345879,
      "end_ms": 348430
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "But she did.",
      "start_ms": 348430,
      "end_ms": 349219
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "She fell asleep almost immediately.",
      "start_ms": 349219,
      "end_ms": 351406
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "She slept for four hours.",
      "start_ms": 351406,
      "end_ms": 352985
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "She had strange dreams.",
      "start_ms": 352985,
      "end_ms": 354443
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "She dreamed about her mother's kitchen in Frankfurt.",
      "start_ms": 354443,
      "end_ms": 357662
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "She dreamed about her father's small apartment in Singapore.",
      "start_ms": 357662,
      "end_ms": 361367
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "She dreamed she was in a village in central Turkey with a very old man who was cooking.",
      "start_ms": 361367,
      "end_ms": 366712
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "When she woke up, at six in the morning, Nazan was still there.",
      "start_ms": 366712,
      "end_ms": 370599
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Her hand was on Sena's shoulder.",
      "start_ms": 370599,
      "end_ms": 372604
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "She was reading a small book.",
      "start_ms": 372604,
      "end_ms": 374426
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "She looked down.",
      "start_ms": 374426,
      "end_ms": 375458
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "She smiled.",
      "start_ms": 375458,
      "end_ms": 376187
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "She said, \"You slept well.",
      "start_ms": 376187,
      "end_ms": 377827
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "That is good.",
      "start_ms": 377827,
      "end_ms": 378678
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Now we should eat something and freshen up.",
      "start_ms": 378678,
      "end_ms": 381350
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "My flight is in two hours.",
      "start_ms": 381350,
      "end_ms": 382990
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Yours is in three.\"",
      "start_ms": 382990,
      "end_ms": 384144
    }
  ]
}